Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.13,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\NThen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\NAnd freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I could burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, at Candy Factory Town,\Nin the center of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bostama?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's chewing right\Nthrough the factory walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like he was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My fangs eat for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want some trendy cappuccino latte
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,thing or fancy sponge\Ncake when I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That junk's not real food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell do I look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good, because you're starting\Nto look pretty tasty yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For a snack, I like fish\Nbones, and I like them big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure thing. Big fish bones. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go whim my appetite on some\Nsoldiers and maybe the Ryo family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll see the rest of\Nyou bums at Conchcord Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We all have to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do about\Nthe citizens? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you morons pay attention\Nto a word Captain Horde said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He told us, no more\Nstepping on her picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Those losers will get what's\Ncoming to them soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to\Nstand up to these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Including Heart, the new Fishman pirates\Nhave Horshark Fishman as officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And a giant squidfishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention their bodyguard\Nis a blue-ringed octopus
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,merman known as the best\Nswordsman on the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the Neptune brothers are\Nthe only hope we've got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all we can do is keep the faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At Waterwheel Town in the\Nisland's northern region.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The princes are making\Ntheir way to Concord Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This country's in such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All we wanted to do was improve\Nour relationship with the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to threaten everyone\Nwith death like some kind of madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And on top of those threats,\Nthey want to execute the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Heart will be\Nwilling to bargain with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we've got his men held hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan isn't going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Heart would rather you\Ncut us Downson than negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's more ruthless than\Nthe other fishman pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he looks\NDownson on the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the prince has defeated him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Officer Dosan's power level\Nhas dropped to Downson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's just weak and gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give him an energy steroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking about it just brings\Nme Downson. It's depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart doesn't like fishmen who\Ndo business with human pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll give them the Bumson without mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumson?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All those fishmen who donated their\Nblood to help out wounded humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave them the old Whompson\Nin the dark of night. Whompson?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardy believes that human\Nblood is naturally tainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And whenever we receive their\Nblood or offer them our own,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we dose in our pure blood under service!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's back to saying doctor now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Any fishman who supports humans is\Na traitor and needs to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Our people will never be able\Nto advance with them in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go whamson on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's higher than thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The chains are shattered!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They knocked him out with\None swing! Mukabushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you back with a slant, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll smash your face\Nwith a big, fat boom, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My enemies will face doom, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the Cunchcord Plaza for\Nthe execution! Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,At the south part of the island, in\Nfront of the Fishman Cultural Hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you call it drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny anymore, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no shape to fight like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you worry too much, pal. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Drinks are on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not important right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukaboshi is leading\NNeptune's army into the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to be ready for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even worse, if things go bad,\NJinbe might even show up to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a joke, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's weak as a sea cucumber\Nand just as slippery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get your head\Nspinning around like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I'm standing still!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How drunk are you? This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt Yasuie can even hold his sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from him immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:07:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie will slice into anyone and\Neveryone when he's this drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You slice anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He attacked his own guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I can fight just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yasuie, why don't\Nyou go to the plaza?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There you can cut up the royal\Nfamily as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:09:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, know why, uh, nah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that even supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,At the marine shopping mall in\Nthe east part of the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you pathetic civilian stand\Na chance you're dumber than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Beach can blend in perfectly with the\Nsurroundings to camouflage himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a chameleon\NHe might be on our side,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but even we have trouble\Nfiguring out where he is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.66,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What this is unfair how are we supposed\Nto fight someone we can't even see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well start begging for\Nthe Neptune brothers to bail you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Without them you're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Though frankly don't expect\Nthem to last long either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well time to finish you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we get it? Is it dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.44,0:09:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools have nowhere to run. It's only a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,matter of time before\Nwe hunt you all down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping our\Nwrath. He's talking like
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing happened we\Njust beat him to a boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What class no wonder he's called\Nthe noble of the fishman district?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Later on today, at Conchcord Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Neptune family will die,\Nand a new king will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's head to the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer before\Nwe arrive at the plaza?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Less than an hour, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Executing the king at Conchcord\NPlaza feels calculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not just do it at the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Heart might be trying\Nto lure you princes into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That is no concern to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:10:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not let them murder our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And I refuse to let our citizens'
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,hearts and minds become closed\Noff after all we've worked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe kept Heart under his watchful eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I see that we should\Nhave taken note of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably the reason human pirates\Nhave stopped coming here as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,an issue we should have\Ninvestigated sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandy, do you think Shirahoshi\Nis still in the hardshell tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't heard anything\Nabout Sis in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's really starting\Nto bug Mayfassola!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you feel about the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I didn't think\Nthey were bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Charlie said that\Nthey destroyed the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but so far they seem like\Nthe least of our worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They have caused their share of\Ntrouble, but they may be victims too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats G-Mae's friend, and the\Nmermaids didn't have a problem with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And frankly, their\Njudgment is really wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed, but this is not the time nor\Nthe place to ponder such questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to focus, Solatido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon every soldier that\Nthe country has to offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to save our\Nking at any cost! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At Fishfilly Hills in the\Nnortheast part of the island...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too tough! Damn it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we shouldn't be having this much trouble\Nfighting against just one sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again, it seems\Nsomething is amiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy steroids are making him crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down, Zoro. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The soldiers are barely alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our job here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea kings don't like fire. Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the I don't think his arms are\Nsupposed to bend back like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be under some kind of a curse\Nyou idiot put out that fire right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakehi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:12:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He said something about fire? Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cook up some smoked squid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we'd eat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to roast me and\Nhave me with a glass of sake, he.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When I recover, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.47,0:13:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about how one of Ikoros'\Nbest friends was a giant squid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, he swam too close to the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you know it, he\Nwas a giant dried squid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Icarus freaks\Nout when he sees fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dinolos!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he's a fish man, he doesn't\Nhave anything to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinol!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No more fire! Got me here! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That dried squid spear is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.34,0:13:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns back into a normal squid by sucking\Nall the fluid out of anyone it strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:13:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's as good as jerky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Icarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,First he got dried out\Nand then this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, boss Icarus, I\Nthink he's had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time we start\Nmaking our way to Conchcord Plaza?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that\Nguy. Leave him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to see this, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that him up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see Heart, but I do see\Nother men from the Fishman District!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be heading\Nfor the Conchcord Plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They still have King Neptune hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let them beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Great night!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You people need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no great knight. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even save my poor citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What good is a king's army if it\Ncan't even protect the king it serves?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're an embarrassment to this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Siricaros, just two hours\Nleft to the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with us to Conchcord Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Captain Heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he not with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he talking to me directly here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That drug enhances your strength\Nat the cost of your lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have taken\Nit in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Heart was injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The human pirate swordsman cut him\Nin the gashes too painful to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain got injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His body wouldn't stop hurting,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,so he kept taking energy\Nsteroids to help kill the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We told him to stop, but he\Nwouldn't listen to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Captain! Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm gonna explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The drug side effects are\Nbad enough to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you now, Sea Bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he must be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But all these Sea Monsters have been under
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Forty's control\Nfor a really long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what would spook him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit blubbering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, things will start looking up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get back in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I would ever take advice\Nfrom a couple of losers like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have no idea what it's\Nlike having your heart broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These feelings are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.48,0:17:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wanted her since\NI first saw her. Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,she was just a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but I knew if I married her, I\Ncould fulfill my ancestor's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just not my type! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my type, she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When the words came to my\Nears, I felt my love grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A flawless haiku by Vandertick\Nin the night, I suspect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's aching!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,After she rejected me, I felt like it\Nwas time for a change, so I cut my hair
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.66,0:18:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd kill her instead,\Nbut I can't even get that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know she's alive because I\Ncan still throw things at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not Straw Hat's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny? My idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't end her existence, then\NI'll just have to end everyone else's!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,NEPOSAL
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune's Army is done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The party is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister of the Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister of the Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We were finally supposed to see results.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This was going to be our\Nyear at the World Summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But then they had to come and ruin\Neverything. Someone help us save the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,king if we don't stop them soon he will\Nbe executed surely someone can fight
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't get in they locked the\Nentrance to the plaza behind them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kingdom tune. Let's scale the\Nwall. Maybe we can see inside hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.20,0:21:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us make haste, Megalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you soldiers were\Nsupposed to protect this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My men!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look alive, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That soldier's up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's packing dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna blow everyone up with\Nsome kind of suicide attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he does that, I'm\Ngonna turn into roasted squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.70,0:22:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The three princes should get here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.78,0:22:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can take out at least\None of you before they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.64,0:22:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Water shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How far can it go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That whistling sound! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.84,0:23:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression the\Nwater shot wasn't that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it took a lot of energy\Nsteroid to get that tough, but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:23:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We never anticipated it changing your hair
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:24:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,color or increasing your\Nmuscle mass so greatly,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.59,0:24:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.50,0:24:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.02,0:24:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't the soldiers\Nwait for us to have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukaboshi, Ryoboshi, Mamboshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.62,0:24:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.16,0:24:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Both their ranks and their sea\Nmonsters have been empowered by a drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.80,0:24:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.10,0:24:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On an even playing field, Neptune's\Narmy would never lose a sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.54,0:24:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.50,0:25:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to mumble. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.56,0:25:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you understand\Nyou're all so pathetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.06,0:25:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you new fishman pirates are\Njust a bunch of cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The other islanders let go of their hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.20,0:25:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,feelings brought on by\Nthe humans discrimination!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.32,0:25:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And despite the fact that\Nhumans murdered their
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.32,0:25:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,hero and their queen\Nthey're willing to forgive!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.06,0:25:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Them even after all of\Ntheir suffering they still
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.14,0:25:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,sign their names because\Nthey want to change the?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.10,0:25:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,future.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.01,0:25:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.56,0:25:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for the Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What you do undermines their efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.88,0:25:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.26,0:25:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you recognize their bravery?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.74,0:25:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.38,0:25:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mistake their kindness for courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.12,0:25:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He gives the humans another\Nexcuse to take advantage of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.06,0:26:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You seek revenge, not for\Njustice, but because of your
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Own personal hatred. I won't\Nlet you take the king's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.20,0:26:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,nor the island his citizens call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.84,0:26:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never have the Ryugu kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.10,0:26:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have known we\Ncould count on the princes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.44,0:26:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We will never be defeated, because we've\Nbeen granted a power that is absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.32,0:26:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that power we will rule this\Ncountry the way it was always meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.42,0:26:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The future of this country is peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.78,0:26:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,peace with the humans and peace\Nwith that monsters like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.10,0:27:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't triumph here\Nwe'll have failed and
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.14,0:27:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it will be hundreds of\Nyears before we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.86,0:27:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Another shot at friendship\Nwith the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.22,0:27:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, the winners of this\Nfight will rule this country. Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.10,0:27:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They look... stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.88,0:27:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.60,0:27:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.84,0:28:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running short, little old.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.22,0:28:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Be safe, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.10,0:28:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.76,0:28:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.20,0:28:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.46,0:28:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
